：\"夫聖人嘉善矜愚，忘過記功，以成美化。加今王業始建，將一大統，此乃漢高棄瑕錄用之時也，若令善惡異流，貴汝穎月旦之評，誠可以厲俗明教，然恐未易行也。宜遠模仲尼之泛愛，中則郭泰之弘濟，近有益於大道也。\"艷不能行，卒以致敗。","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-057-lumao:line074:m0001","start":1,"end":2,"surface":"瑁","kind":"person","person_id":"36u_j3u_i3z","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-057-lumao:line074:m0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"子璋","kind":"person","person_id":"36u_j3u_i3z","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-057-lumao:line074:m0008","start":8,"end":9,"surface":"遜","kind":"person","person_id":"lii_454_vuv","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-057-lumao:line074:m0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"陳融","kind":"person","person_id":"7zk_tzn_4nb","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-057-lumao:line074:m0025","start":25,"end":28,"surface":"濮陽逸","kind":"person","person_id":"3yy_t64_6nq","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-057-lumao:line074:m0031","start":31,"end":33,"surface":"蔣纂","kind":"person","person_id":"0fw_jau_stm","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-057-lumao:line074:m0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"袁迪","kind":"person","person_id":"lmz_gih_9xn","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-057-lumao:line074:m0047","start":47,"end":48,"surface":"瑁","kind":"person","person_id":"36u_j3u_i3z","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-057-lumao:line074:m0051","start":51,"end":52,"surface":"瑁","kind":"person","person_id":"36u_j3u_i3z","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-057-lumao:line074:m0065","start":65,"end":67,"surface":"徐原","kind":"person","person_id":"f79_bt